  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.RavenDBOASIS v2.0.3\n\nRavenDB OASIS Provider — .NET-native document database for OASIS holons and avatars via the official RavenDB.Client SDK. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- Add bounded RavenDB CQL and correct activation and save ownership (9fe662c)\n- Integrate verified RavenDB native storage (129f953)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- Support caller-owned RavenDB client certificates with HTTPS validation (03080f7)\n- Validate GUID native keys before avatar deletion in forty adapters (597758b)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.RavenDBOASIS",
